        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>6 Inch Acrylic Cabinet Pull, FII-8211AC/6</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese all new modern clear acrylic cabinet handles are hand made in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions from the finest acrylic available. The  acrylic is manufactured with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe retro-modern design of these space age acrylic cabinet handles is really stunning. Our pictures do not do them justice. The mounting brackets are finished in polished brass.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching <a href=\"/products/pacific-acrylic-door-pull-first-impressions-pcf100sbr\"><b>Appliance Handles</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/clear-acrylic-14-inch-shower-door-pulls-pair-fii-sd-cfrbac-14\"><b>Shower Door Handles</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions FII-8211AC/6 Modern  Cabinet Handles\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Acrylic Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Length:  6\" overall</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center:  3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Clearance: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Bracket Finishes: 3</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: These acrylic cabinet handles are handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting screws for a standard 3/4\"  thick  cabinet door or drawer.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>* Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
